00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:14,740
( Watch on Kissasia.vip )

1
00:01:37,105 --> 00:01:39,805
[Episode 3]

2
00:02:12,605 --> 00:02:17,307
The way you and Jiao Chao Gui
went at each other...

3
00:02:17,307 --> 00:02:19,505
was truly spectacular.

4
00:02:19,505 --> 00:02:21,271
I misunderstood you.

5
00:02:21,271 --> 00:02:23,425
Why didn't you defend yourself?

6
00:02:25,645 --> 00:02:27,815
I told you before.

7
00:02:27,815 --> 00:02:29,885
I have too many enemies.

8
00:02:29,885 --> 00:02:33,165
It's safer for you to take him alone.

9
00:02:33,165 --> 00:02:35,565
If we hadn't gotten here in time,

10
00:02:35,565 --> 00:02:40,145
you might have been killed by Jiao Chao Gui
while trying to hide our tracks, you know?

11
00:02:41,871 --> 00:02:43,671
Is it that in your mind,

12
00:02:43,671 --> 00:02:45,005
only you can protect us,

13
00:02:45,005 --> 00:02:46,905
but we cannot protect you?

14
00:02:49,505 --> 00:02:51,465
That's not what I meant.

15
00:03:00,405 --> 00:03:03,245
Just because I'm new to this world
doesn't mean I'm ignorant.

16
00:03:03,245 --> 00:03:06,688
Roaming this world,
who doesn't make a few enemies?

17
00:03:06,688 --> 00:03:10,845
That Jiao Chao Gui came for me
with a sword formation.

18
00:03:10,845 --> 00:03:12,738
That clearly marks him as my enemy.

19
00:03:12,738 --> 00:03:14,365
Don't take it all on yourself,

20
00:03:14,365 --> 00:03:17,545
as if you're the only one
worthy of having enemies.

21
00:03:19,385 --> 00:03:21,938
I truly didn't mean it that way.

22
00:03:24,965 --> 00:03:29,605
I think we should help each other
deal with each other's enemies on this journey.

23
00:03:30,371 --> 00:03:32,925
I guarantee neither of us will lose out.

24
00:03:33,925 --> 00:03:36,005
Huo, you're right.

25
00:03:36,005 --> 00:03:37,625
That makes sense.

26
00:03:44,965 --> 00:03:47,612
What exactly happened with your injury?

27
00:03:50,365 --> 00:03:52,515
I don't want to bring you trouble.

28
00:03:52,515 --> 00:03:55,805
We've been through life
and death situations together, right?

29
00:03:55,805 --> 00:03:58,185
Why are you still keeping secrets?

30
00:04:00,365 --> 00:04:02,471
I have an old friend.

31
00:04:02,471 --> 00:04:04,224
He was a constable in Yicheng County.

32
00:04:04,224 --> 00:04:07,211
He uncovered a major case
and was persecuted for it.

33
00:04:07,211 --> 00:04:10,725
My injury was sustained while saving him.

34
00:04:10,725 --> 00:04:12,659
So, did you save him?

35
00:04:14,485 --> 00:04:18,771
As he lay dying, he entrusted the case to me.

36
00:04:18,771 --> 00:04:21,425
I cannot fail his final request.

37
00:04:34,938 --> 00:04:38,504
The Xiuluo Cult is notorious
for all manner of wickedness,

38
00:04:38,504 --> 00:04:40,955
Villainy is their daily bread.

39
00:04:40,955 --> 00:04:43,605
But why would the Shangqing Sect
want to target you?

40
00:04:44,424 --> 00:04:47,987
The one who injured me
was not from the Shangqing Sect.

41
00:04:47,987 --> 00:04:49,545
It was Zhi Hua, the Black Fox.

42
00:04:49,545 --> 00:04:50,804
How is that possible?

43
00:04:50,804 --> 00:04:54,177
The Great Benevolence Palm
is a secret skill of the Shangqing Sect.

44
00:04:54,177 --> 00:04:57,457
Even their own disciples
may not receive the true teaching.

45
00:04:57,457 --> 00:04:59,944
Furthermore, their palm techniques
have been passed down orally for ages.

46
00:04:59,944 --> 00:05:01,378
There are no written manuals.

47
00:05:01,965 --> 00:05:03,565
It's impossible for an outsider to steal it.

48
00:05:03,565 --> 00:05:06,179
This point baffles me as well.

49
00:05:12,205 --> 00:05:14,498
Forget it. I'll believe you for now.

50
00:05:14,498 --> 00:05:16,555
You still have many questions?

51
00:05:16,555 --> 00:05:20,344
I know it couldn't have been easy for you
to say even this much just now.

52
00:05:20,344 --> 00:05:22,371
Since I've decided you're not a bad person,

53
00:05:22,371 --> 00:05:24,145
let's leave it at that for now.

54
00:05:28,438 --> 00:05:31,098
So, are we friends now?

55
00:05:31,938 --> 00:05:34,897
Let's wait until he settles his affairs first.

56
00:05:34,897 --> 00:05:36,064
For now...

57
00:05:36,885 --> 00:05:39,261
we are just temporary partners.

58
00:05:41,804 --> 00:05:45,785
Partners on the road to the capital!

59
00:06:02,205 --> 00:06:03,565
What are you thinking about, Huo?

60
00:06:03,565 --> 00:06:07,217
I was wondering why Shengyun Stronghold
would have a sword formation designed

61
00:06:07,217 --> 00:06:09,317
to counter Linglong Manor's techniques.

62
00:06:09,885 --> 00:06:12,245
Jiao Chao Gui refused to tell me why.

63
00:06:12,245 --> 00:06:13,845
There must be a conspiracy behind this.

64
00:06:13,845 --> 00:06:17,045
The reason behind it might be very simple.

65
00:06:17,045 --> 00:06:22,085
So simple that only someone
as pure-hearted as you would fail to see it.

66
00:06:22,685 --> 00:06:25,588
There are the Three Famous Manors
in this world:

67
00:06:25,588 --> 00:06:28,971
Golden Bawang, Silver Shengyun,
and Jade Linglong.

68
00:06:28,971 --> 00:06:32,218
Bawang Manor fell into decline ten years ago.

69
00:06:32,218 --> 00:06:36,945
You mean they devoted themselves to research
to seize the title of the Number One Manor?

70
00:06:36,945 --> 00:06:38,205
Yes.

71
00:06:38,205 --> 00:06:42,705
His loss to you made the issue
of challenging Linglong Manor untenable.

72
00:06:42,705 --> 00:06:44,805
So he simply brushed it off.

73
00:06:44,805 --> 00:06:46,738
They spent years on that research.

74
00:06:46,738 --> 00:06:49,345
If I hadn't discovered it by chance
and broken the sword formation,

75
00:06:49,925 --> 00:06:52,605
Linglong Manor might have suffered a disaster.

76
00:06:52,605 --> 00:06:53,625
Rest assured, Huo.

77
00:06:53,625 --> 00:06:57,565
The Master of Linglong must have seen through
Shengyun Stronghold's intentions long ago.

78
00:06:57,565 --> 00:06:59,665
He won't just wait for disaster.

79
00:07:01,125 --> 00:07:07,071
I heard that Bawang Manor's decline was
because they challenged the Linyuan Sect,

80
00:07:07,071 --> 00:07:09,138
and were ultimately annihilated by them.

81
00:07:09,138 --> 00:07:10,885
The lesson is right there.

82
00:07:10,885 --> 00:07:13,738
Why would Shengyun Stronghold
still vie for supremacy?

83
00:07:13,738 --> 00:07:15,611
Do they not fear the same fate?

84
00:07:15,611 --> 00:07:17,365
Before Bawang Manor was destroyed,

85
00:07:17,365 --> 00:07:20,565
it did enjoy a glorious time
as the Number One Manor.

86
00:07:21,504 --> 00:07:25,171
In these rivalries,
history records only the champion.

87
00:07:25,171 --> 00:07:27,671
That is likely why Jiao Chao Gui
is so unwilling to let it go.

88
00:07:27,671 --> 00:07:31,271
Isn't the point of martial arts
to protect oneself and uphold justice?

89
00:07:31,271 --> 00:07:34,325
This endless cycle of winning and losing...

90
00:07:34,325 --> 00:07:35,650
What is the point of it all?

91
00:07:35,650 --> 00:07:37,898
Spend more time in this world,

92
00:07:37,898 --> 00:07:40,285
you will get used to such things.

93
00:07:40,285 --> 00:07:44,585
If I thought like them,
I might as well just go home now.

94
00:07:45,645 --> 00:07:47,405
I wish I were like you.

95
00:07:47,405 --> 00:07:50,905
You know everything,
yet you don't care about any of it.

96
00:07:57,925 --> 00:08:00,859
Let's find a tea stall to rest for a bit.

97
00:09:03,845 --> 00:09:05,705
[Granny Hanshui, Master of The Hanshui Palace]

98
00:09:17,845 --> 00:09:19,724
Chang Hong Bi.

99
00:09:19,724 --> 00:09:24,058
I have been waiting for you for a long time.

100
00:09:24,685 --> 00:09:26,510
Granny has come in person to fetch you.

101
00:09:26,510 --> 00:09:28,024
Hurry up and come here.

102
00:09:28,925 --> 00:09:30,405
His name is not Chang Hong Bi,

103
00:09:30,405 --> 00:09:32,297
and he won't be going back with you.

104
00:09:32,297 --> 00:09:34,428
Where did this brat come from?

105
00:09:34,428 --> 00:09:36,325
Step aside at once.

106
00:09:36,325 --> 00:09:40,241
I will have them leave your corpse intact.

107
00:09:42,005 --> 00:09:43,705
If you want to take him,

108
00:09:43,705 --> 00:09:45,471
you'll have to kill me first.

109
00:09:51,871 --> 00:09:53,430
No!

110
00:09:53,430 --> 00:09:55,725
So you're a youngster from the Huo family.

111
00:09:55,725 --> 00:09:58,605
So young, yet your skills are quite impressive.

112
00:09:58,605 --> 00:10:00,405
What a pity.

113
00:10:08,705 --> 00:10:12,465
Zhang Yue. So this is the person you mentioned?

114
00:10:12,465 --> 00:10:13,545
Precisely.

115
00:10:13,545 --> 00:10:16,538
He is actually faster than my staff.

116
00:10:16,538 --> 00:10:18,605
Interesting.

117
00:10:28,671 --> 00:10:30,805
Not only are you severely injured,

118
00:10:30,805 --> 00:10:33,065
but also poisoned.

119
00:10:33,065 --> 00:10:35,289
Do you really intend to strike
a rock with an egg?

120
00:10:35,289 --> 00:10:36,828
Zhan!

121
00:10:38,805 --> 00:10:42,165
The poison in your body was never cured.

122
00:10:42,165 --> 00:10:44,371
The medicinal properties are gone
from my blood.

123
00:10:44,371 --> 00:10:45,671
Am I right?

124
00:10:45,671 --> 00:10:47,765
You knew it all along.

125
00:10:49,445 --> 00:10:51,645
You were originally mute,

126
00:10:51,645 --> 00:10:53,885
but gradually you became able to speak.

127
00:10:53,885 --> 00:10:57,504
The medicinal scent about you
grows fainter each day.

128
00:10:57,504 --> 00:10:59,485
I am already a useless person.

129
00:10:59,485 --> 00:11:01,619
Why didn't you tell me?

130
00:11:04,071 --> 00:11:08,385
Only by losing the medicinal properties
can you become human again.

131
00:11:28,925 --> 00:11:30,471
Zhan!

132
00:11:31,805 --> 00:11:33,471
Zhang Ri, Zhang Yue.

133
00:11:33,471 --> 00:11:36,538
Kill these two and take Chang Hong Bi away.

134
00:11:36,538 --> 00:11:38,305
- Granny.
- What?

135
00:11:38,305 --> 00:11:39,671
Have you gone soft?

136
00:11:39,671 --> 00:11:40,738
I wouldn't dare.

137
00:11:40,738 --> 00:11:42,038
Do it.

138
00:11:48,338 --> 00:11:49,704
Stop!

139
00:11:54,450 --> 00:11:56,128
Granny, I'll go back with you.

140
00:11:56,128 --> 00:11:58,004
As long as you let them go.

141
00:11:58,004 --> 00:12:01,165
- No!
- Chang Hong Bi's secret must remain hidden.

142
00:12:01,165 --> 00:12:03,605
These two must die.

143
00:12:03,605 --> 00:12:06,305
If they die, I will not live on alone.

144
00:12:06,305 --> 00:12:08,265
Then you will never get Chang Hong Bi.

145
00:12:08,265 --> 00:12:09,938
You've grown quite bold,

146
00:12:09,938 --> 00:12:11,585
daring to threaten me?

147
00:12:11,585 --> 00:12:14,471
I would brave all dangers to protect them.

148
00:12:14,471 --> 00:12:17,871
Are these two worth trading your life for?

149
00:12:17,871 --> 00:12:21,971
Granny, you must think that I was kidnapped
by Su Yi Zhou by force, right?

150
00:12:21,971 --> 00:12:25,325
Don't tell me you chose to follow him.

151
00:12:25,325 --> 00:12:27,605
I wanted to leave on my own.

152
00:12:27,605 --> 00:12:30,405
Su Yi Zhou once predicted
that I would die at 15.

153
00:12:30,405 --> 00:12:33,555
When a person realizes that,
no matter how they endure humiliation,

154
00:12:33,555 --> 00:12:35,815
they won't live for long,

155
00:12:35,815 --> 00:12:38,604
surely they want to see the outside world.

156
00:12:38,604 --> 00:12:42,618
So, I took advantage of your seclusion,

157
00:12:42,618 --> 00:12:46,525
tricked the two hunting dogs guarding
the gates, and left the palace.

158
00:12:46,525 --> 00:12:50,585
So, is the outside world beautiful?

159
00:12:51,845 --> 00:12:53,971
Ever since I left Hanshui Palace,

160
00:12:53,971 --> 00:12:57,324
I've been fought over by all sorts of people,
and abused.

161
00:12:57,324 --> 00:12:59,415
Only the two of them treated me
like a human being.

162
00:12:59,415 --> 00:13:03,105
They protected me like a treasure,
never coveting the secrets I hold.

163
00:13:03,105 --> 00:13:06,605
If there is someone in this world
willing to risk their life for me,

164
00:13:06,605 --> 00:13:10,405
then I am naturally willing to die for them.

165
00:13:10,405 --> 00:13:15,471
After you die,
I can simply find a new Chang Hong Bi.

166
00:13:15,471 --> 00:13:19,705
With your skills,
finding another Chang Hong Bi isn't hard.

167
00:13:20,504 --> 00:13:22,305
But every four months,

168
00:13:22,305 --> 00:13:26,571
you must have my assistance to
continue practicing the Luotian Great Art.

169
00:13:26,571 --> 00:13:31,371
Counting now, it's been over three months
since the last session.

170
00:13:31,371 --> 00:13:34,938
If you reach a critical juncture
without my aid,

171
00:13:34,938 --> 00:13:40,081
you'd likely need to wait another 10
or 20 years for a breakthrough.

172
00:13:40,081 --> 00:13:41,938
Can you afford to wait that long?

173
00:13:41,938 --> 00:13:44,541
Besides, if a Chang Hong Bi
were so easy to find,

174
00:13:44,541 --> 00:13:48,625
you wouldn't have had to come
to these desolate mountains yourself.

175
00:14:03,338 --> 00:14:04,485
Fine.

176
00:14:05,485 --> 00:14:07,752
I promise you.

177
00:14:19,185 --> 00:14:24,485
I didn't expect you to be so bold
and meticulous,

178
00:14:24,485 --> 00:14:26,945
so brave and resourceful.

179
00:14:28,085 --> 00:14:30,885
I truly underestimated you.

180
00:14:35,565 --> 00:14:37,538
You can't go back!

181
00:14:37,538 --> 00:14:40,645
You are the first person
who has ever shed tears for me.

182
00:14:40,645 --> 00:14:45,471
To have someone grieve for me...

183
00:14:45,471 --> 00:14:48,185
I count myself fortunate.

184
00:14:49,571 --> 00:14:50,938
Don't go!

185
00:14:52,105 --> 00:14:55,405
The outside world may be treacherous,

186
00:14:55,405 --> 00:14:57,438
but it has people I care about.

187
00:14:58,004 --> 00:15:00,705
One day, I will leave Hanshui Palace

188
00:15:00,705 --> 00:15:03,738
and I will find you again.

189
00:15:18,871 --> 00:15:22,345
Your real name isn't actually
Huo Xiao Di, is it?

190
00:15:22,345 --> 00:15:26,138
Could you bestow that name upon me?

191
00:15:29,338 --> 00:15:32,271
Wonderful! I have a name again.

192
00:15:42,565 --> 00:15:44,285
[Chang Hong Bi]

193
00:15:45,285 --> 00:15:47,305
[Huo Xiao Di]

194
00:16:36,971 --> 00:16:38,605
You're awake.

195
00:16:50,171 --> 00:16:51,904
Chang Hong Bi...

196
00:16:51,904 --> 00:16:54,245
He's called Huo Xiao Di now.

197
00:16:58,565 --> 00:17:01,025
I gave him my name.

198
00:17:02,205 --> 00:17:05,765
He returned with the people
from Hanshui Palace to rescue us.

199
00:17:05,765 --> 00:17:07,661
I still couldn't save him.

200
00:17:07,661 --> 00:17:09,605
Once I settle my affairs,

201
00:17:09,605 --> 00:17:12,070
we will go to Hanshui Palace together.

202
00:17:12,070 --> 00:17:15,571
But rescuing someone from Granny Hanshui
is no easy task.

203
00:17:18,204 --> 00:17:19,971
We'll find a way.

204
00:17:26,125 --> 00:17:28,985
Clarity eludes me more each moment.

205
00:17:30,471 --> 00:17:34,455
For a century, Hanshui Palace has rarely
been involved in worldly strife.

206
00:17:34,455 --> 00:17:36,845
Even if Chang Hong Bi is a coveted prize,

207
00:17:36,845 --> 00:17:40,108
Granny Hanshui's fearsome reputation
deterred challengers.

208
00:17:40,108 --> 00:17:43,471
Why are the Tang Sect and Shengyun Stronghold
both making moves?

209
00:17:44,085 --> 00:17:47,495
How did they know the exact time
Granny Hanshui was in seclusion?

210
00:17:47,495 --> 00:17:50,171
With the strength of Shengyun Stronghold
and the Tang Sect,

211
00:17:50,904 --> 00:17:54,305
they would never dare to storm Hanshui Palace.

212
00:17:54,305 --> 00:17:58,365
So this secret must have come
from within the palace.

213
00:17:59,365 --> 00:18:01,095
Su Yi Zhou?

214
00:18:01,095 --> 00:18:04,845
While you were unconscious,
Xiao Di mentioned Su Yi Zhou.

215
00:18:04,845 --> 00:18:09,505
He said Su Yi Zhou predicted
he wouldn't live past 15.

216
00:18:09,505 --> 00:18:12,005
That's why he decided to come out
and see the world.

217
00:18:13,485 --> 00:18:16,041
Su Yi Zhou was hailed as the world's
greatest fortune-teller.

218
00:18:16,041 --> 00:18:19,271
Legends say he could glimpse heavenly secrets.

219
00:18:21,288 --> 00:18:25,671
However, he died three years ago.

220
00:18:26,345 --> 00:18:29,405
The reason Bawang Manor clashed
with the Linyuan Sect

221
00:18:29,405 --> 00:18:32,171
was because Su Yi Zhou predicted

222
00:18:32,171 --> 00:18:35,555
that Bawang Manor would be wiped out
by the Linyuan Sect.

223
00:18:35,555 --> 00:18:37,771
The master of Bawang Manor could not rest,

224
00:18:37,771 --> 00:18:40,738
so he finally decided to strike first.

225
00:18:40,738 --> 00:18:43,625
In the end, the entire manor was slaughtered.

226
00:18:44,485 --> 00:18:48,045
The master blamed Su Yi Zhou
had instigated the conflict.

227
00:18:48,045 --> 00:18:50,538
With his last breath, he tracked him down.

228
00:18:50,538 --> 00:18:54,371
Su Yi Zhou's wife died while protecting him.

229
00:18:54,371 --> 00:18:57,305
Since then, Su Yi Zhou became a broken man.

230
00:18:57,305 --> 00:19:00,805
He told everyone he met
that he couldn't tell fortunes at all.

231
00:19:00,805 --> 00:19:05,965
Otherwise, he wouldn't have failed
to foresee his own wife's fate.

232
00:19:05,965 --> 00:19:08,115
Then who is this person pretending
to be Su Yi Zhou?

233
00:19:08,115 --> 00:19:11,285
Anyone brazen enough to enter Hanshui Palace
and deceive Granny Hanshui

234
00:19:11,285 --> 00:19:17,285
would need an escape plan
and possess superb skills in disguise.

235
00:19:18,605 --> 00:19:20,504
Disguise skills?

236
00:19:23,505 --> 00:19:27,085
Is it the ever-changing Black Fox, Zhi Hua?

237
00:19:28,085 --> 00:19:29,418
It's him again.

238
00:19:30,204 --> 00:19:34,835
What does he gain by tricking Chang Hong Bi out
and pitting Shengyun against the Tang Sect?

239
00:19:34,835 --> 00:19:39,071
Using such methods to make
the two factions fight seems far too indirect.

240
00:19:39,071 --> 00:19:42,171
Perhaps that wasn't his primary goal.

241
00:19:42,171 --> 00:19:45,368
He just wants Hanshui Palace
to lose its secret treasure,

242
00:19:45,368 --> 00:19:47,271
so he can deal with them.

243
00:19:47,271 --> 00:19:48,745
Does he have a grudge against them?

244
00:19:48,745 --> 00:19:50,405
Regardless of any grudge,

245
00:19:50,405 --> 00:19:53,971
now that Chang Hong Bi
has returned to Hanshui Palace,

246
00:19:53,971 --> 00:19:56,405
he won't let it go.

247
00:20:02,445 --> 00:20:04,888
I hope Xiao Di will be safe.

248
00:20:04,888 --> 00:20:08,605
I'm afraid Hanshui Palace
will never know peace again.

249
00:20:15,592 --> 00:20:17,585
Get some more rest.

250
00:20:19,125 --> 00:20:20,944
Let's hurry and leave.

251
00:20:20,944 --> 00:20:22,911
The pursuers will be here soon.

252
00:20:26,248 --> 00:20:27,864
If we head northwest,

253
00:20:27,864 --> 00:20:29,985
we should find Xiqiao Ferry.

254
00:20:30,765 --> 00:20:34,145
Northwest. This way. Let's go.

255
00:20:37,605 --> 00:20:42,170
It's truly impressive that you can keep
your bearings in these mountains.

256
00:20:42,170 --> 00:20:43,404
You're not a local.

257
00:20:43,404 --> 00:20:45,655
How are you so familiar with the terrain?

258
00:20:51,465 --> 00:20:53,395
I really don't understand.

259
00:20:53,395 --> 00:20:54,925
You're rushing so recklessly.

260
00:20:54,925 --> 00:20:57,465
Don't you care about your own life at all?

261
00:20:58,605 --> 00:21:02,504
There are things in this world
that are more important than life.

262
00:21:06,605 --> 00:21:09,008
Old Souls at First Glance is acting up again?

263
00:21:28,645 --> 00:21:30,945
He's our target!

264
00:22:01,385 --> 00:22:05,024
Tell Shao Ji Zu that if he keeps
spreading my portrait everywhere,

265
00:22:05,024 --> 00:22:06,808
I won't spare him.

266
00:22:11,071 --> 00:22:12,615
Zhan?

267
00:22:42,271 --> 00:22:43,338
Wake up.

268
00:22:43,338 --> 00:22:44,771
Zhan?

269
00:22:46,671 --> 00:22:48,105
The horse can't run anymore.

270
00:22:48,971 --> 00:22:50,938
The pursuers shouldn't be able
to catch up for a while.

271
00:22:50,938 --> 00:22:52,771
Let's find a place to rest for a bit.

272
00:22:52,771 --> 00:22:54,171
Okay.

273
00:22:58,105 --> 00:22:59,741
Are you all right?

274
00:23:11,485 --> 00:23:12,885
Be careful.

275
00:23:25,471 --> 00:23:26,651
Don't worry about me.

276
00:23:26,651 --> 00:23:28,341
You should leave now.

277
00:23:29,605 --> 00:23:31,871
Why are you saying that again?

278
00:23:46,165 --> 00:23:47,565
[Wanted Notice]
Look carefully.

279
00:23:47,565 --> 00:23:50,501
Their target is me, not you.

280
00:23:57,825 --> 00:23:59,085
Carefully enough?

281
00:23:59,085 --> 00:24:02,005
Shao Ji Zu is looking for you, not me?

282
00:24:03,005 --> 00:24:06,225
The officials sealed the post stations, halted
all horse markets, and searched everywhere.

283
00:24:06,225 --> 00:24:07,965
It's all because of you!

284
00:24:08,965 --> 00:24:11,335
You knew all along? Why didn't you tell me?

285
00:24:11,335 --> 00:24:13,085
I didn't mean to hide it.

286
00:24:13,085 --> 00:24:15,938
You told me before
that your friend was a constable.

287
00:24:15,938 --> 00:24:18,515
Before he died,
he entrusted you with this task.

288
00:24:18,515 --> 00:24:21,045
That's when I concluded
that even if you're not a high official,

289
00:24:21,045 --> 00:24:22,845
you're still a man of the law.

290
00:24:22,845 --> 00:24:24,314
Shao Ji Zu is also a man of the law.

291
00:24:24,314 --> 00:24:26,415
Why is he chasing after you?

292
00:24:27,465 --> 00:24:29,165
I don't know why either.

293
00:24:29,165 --> 00:24:31,305
You still won't tell me the truth.

294
00:24:33,925 --> 00:24:36,525
Even if I don't have a good impression
of Shao Ji Zu,

295
00:24:36,525 --> 00:24:40,905
officials don't typically
hunt each other, right?

296
00:24:49,205 --> 00:24:50,605
Huo...

297
00:24:52,485 --> 00:24:56,565
this matter cannot be judged by common sense.

298
00:24:56,565 --> 00:24:59,568
From the moment I stepped into Xiangzhou,

299
00:24:59,568 --> 00:25:03,038
I've been hunted repeatedly
by both the law and the underworld.

300
00:25:03,625 --> 00:25:08,488
My pursuers wield immense power here,

301
00:25:08,488 --> 00:25:12,038
commanding figures
like Zhi Hua and the Xiuluo Cult.

302
00:25:12,745 --> 00:25:16,375
For them to mobilize the Cavalry and Infantry
Commander Shao Ji Zu,

303
00:25:16,375 --> 00:25:18,885
it's not impossible.

304
00:25:20,185 --> 00:25:22,745
The scale of this power terrifies me.

305
00:25:23,325 --> 00:25:25,165
I just want to know,

306
00:25:25,165 --> 00:25:27,408
who exactly are you,
to have escaped from such a person?

307
00:25:27,408 --> 00:25:29,271
It doesn't matter who I am.

308
00:25:29,885 --> 00:25:33,908
It seems that we cannot return
to the capital together.

309
00:25:33,908 --> 00:25:38,105
You'll escape much more easily on your own.

310
00:25:49,385 --> 00:25:51,145
I won't leave you.

311
00:25:56,817 --> 00:25:58,538
I know, Huo...

312
00:25:59,225 --> 00:26:01,425
that you have a chivalrous heart.

313
00:26:02,125 --> 00:26:06,085
I admire this chivalrous spirit of yours.

314
00:26:06,085 --> 00:26:09,886
But I'm afraid my body can no longer hold out.

315
00:26:15,237 --> 00:26:20,171
So... there is something
I wish to entrust to you.

316
00:26:20,171 --> 00:26:24,008
You mean the matter
your friend entrusted to you?

317
00:26:27,985 --> 00:26:29,968
His name was Liu Hong Yi.

318
00:26:29,968 --> 00:26:31,541
He entrusted this to me with his life.

319
00:26:31,541 --> 00:26:33,015
It must be of great importance.

320
00:26:33,015 --> 00:26:36,138
The dangers I've faced
along the way only prove that this matter

321
00:26:36,138 --> 00:26:40,165
is likely involved in a major case
affecting the entire Xiangzhou.

322
00:26:42,245 --> 00:26:45,945
You want to stay and face the pursuers alone?

323
00:26:49,265 --> 00:26:51,705
I know you refuse to save yourself alone.

324
00:26:52,445 --> 00:26:55,525
But this matter concerns all of Xiangzhou.

325
00:26:55,525 --> 00:26:58,785
This letter must be delivered to the capital.

326
00:26:59,785 --> 00:27:02,324
However, I must warn you first.

327
00:27:02,324 --> 00:27:04,045
If you accept this...

328
00:27:04,825 --> 00:27:07,125
it will bring trouble upon you.

329
00:27:08,685 --> 00:27:10,325
I'll take it.

330
00:27:16,585 --> 00:27:18,185
Rest assured.

331
00:27:18,185 --> 00:27:21,955
I will definitely help you
deliver this safely to the capital.

332
00:27:25,805 --> 00:27:28,565
But once I'm there, whom should I look for?

333
00:27:28,565 --> 00:27:33,428
Since you are acquainted with Prince Zhao,
give it to him.

334
00:27:33,428 --> 00:27:36,505
Once he receives it, he will know what to do.

335
00:27:37,265 --> 00:27:38,805
Remember.

336
00:27:38,805 --> 00:27:40,125
From now on...

337
00:27:40,885 --> 00:27:42,445
don't get involved anymore.

338
00:27:43,445 --> 00:27:45,421
What will you do after I leave?

339
00:27:45,421 --> 00:27:50,085
I'll find a way to stall the pursuers,
to keep them off your trail.

340
00:27:51,085 --> 00:27:53,005
But the road ahead...

341
00:27:53,925 --> 00:27:55,945
you'll be on your own.

342
00:28:02,568 --> 00:28:04,048
I haven't been honest with you.

343
00:28:04,048 --> 00:28:06,024
My real name isn't Huo Xiao Di.

344
00:28:07,425 --> 00:28:12,465
You are a young hero
of unrivaled chivalry from Linglong Manor.

345
00:28:13,285 --> 00:28:15,585
Since you like the name Huo Xiao Di,

346
00:28:16,165 --> 00:28:18,605
then to me, you are the only Huo Xiao Di.

347
00:28:32,645 --> 00:28:34,957
Burning your bridges like this...

348
00:28:36,885 --> 00:28:40,005
you've resolved to fight them to the death,
haven't you?

349
00:28:41,605 --> 00:28:43,805
How could I die so easily?

350
00:28:44,645 --> 00:28:49,565
I must stay alive to seek justice
for my friend.

351
00:28:52,065 --> 00:28:54,088
They're here already?

352
00:29:22,125 --> 00:29:23,691
Can your injured leg hold?

353
00:29:23,691 --> 00:29:24,925
It's functional.

354
00:29:24,925 --> 00:29:26,524
But, to execute A Fleeting Glimpse,

355
00:29:26,524 --> 00:29:28,345
I need to regulate my breathing first.

356
00:29:29,525 --> 00:29:32,025
Can we get up there?

357
00:29:32,025 --> 00:29:34,126
No problem. I can manage that.

358
00:29:34,126 --> 00:29:35,525
Good.

359
00:29:35,525 --> 00:29:36,992
We'll split up.

360
00:29:36,992 --> 00:29:38,826
You hide up there.

361
00:29:38,826 --> 00:29:41,465
When they enter the barn, I'll pin them down.

362
00:29:41,465 --> 00:29:43,425
You take the chance to ambush them.

363
00:29:43,425 --> 00:29:46,891
This group should be
from the same unit as the cavalry earlier.

364
00:29:46,891 --> 00:29:48,691
We can handle them.

365
00:29:48,691 --> 00:29:50,045
Alright.

366
00:30:01,485 --> 00:30:03,045
Is this spot okay?

367
00:30:03,045 --> 00:30:04,395
Stay low.

368
00:30:04,395 --> 00:30:06,245
Don't let them spot you.

369
00:30:11,505 --> 00:30:13,505
Huo, I'm sorry.

370
00:30:13,505 --> 00:30:17,385
Your pressure points will be released
in four hours.

371
00:31:35,865 --> 00:31:38,645
[Zhong Xiong, Flying Trident Guardian]
Zhan Zhao, the Southern Knight.

372
00:31:38,645 --> 00:31:40,485
You truly live up to your reputation.

373
00:31:40,485 --> 00:31:43,185
[Zhan Zhao, the Southern Knight]
We've laid a tight net all along the way.

374
00:31:43,185 --> 00:31:46,685
You've been hunted by
elite government cavalry, and martial artists.

375
00:31:46,685 --> 00:31:49,251
With your portraits circulated,
we've chased you for three days.

376
00:31:49,251 --> 00:31:51,685
And you almost managed
to escape the Xiangzhou border.

377
00:31:51,685 --> 00:31:54,365
I cannot help but be impressed.

378
00:31:54,365 --> 00:31:56,525
I wondered who it was.

379
00:31:56,525 --> 00:31:58,365
So it is you, Chieftain Zhong.

380
00:31:59,365 --> 00:32:00,645
You know me?

381
00:32:00,645 --> 00:32:02,965
Chieftain Zhong is a formidable leader.

382
00:32:02,965 --> 00:32:04,805
Who doesn't know of you?

383
00:32:04,805 --> 00:32:06,645
Since we are both of the same world,

384
00:32:06,645 --> 00:32:08,538
if you hand over that item,

385
00:32:08,538 --> 00:32:10,245
I will not make things difficult for you.

386
00:32:10,245 --> 00:32:12,045
Handing it over isn't the hard part.

387
00:32:12,685 --> 00:32:14,251
I am just curious.

388
00:32:14,251 --> 00:32:18,525
Who is the sacred figure who could make
the retired Flying Trident Guardian return,

389
00:32:18,525 --> 00:32:22,365
gather his old subordinates,

390
00:32:22,365 --> 00:32:24,525
and pledge such desperate loyalty?

391
00:32:25,165 --> 00:32:29,325
And why would Chieftain Zhong
disregard a martial artist's integrity

392
00:32:29,325 --> 00:32:31,185
to do such dirty work?

393
00:32:32,185 --> 00:32:34,965
Capturing the Imperial Cat
counts as dirty work?

394
00:32:34,965 --> 00:32:38,365
As for you, the great Southern Knight
serving as a lapdog,

395
00:32:38,365 --> 00:32:40,485
that news has spread far and wide.

396
00:32:40,485 --> 00:32:43,205
Nowadays,
your reputation is no better than mine.

397
00:32:44,025 --> 00:32:45,192
Enough, Master Zhan.

398
00:32:45,192 --> 00:32:46,825
The poison will kill you soon.

399
00:32:46,825 --> 00:32:48,425
You certainly won't walk out of here.

400
00:32:48,425 --> 00:32:50,992
Hand over the item, and you can suffer less.

401
00:32:50,992 --> 00:32:52,758
If I wanted to avoid suffering,

402
00:32:53,365 --> 00:32:56,885
I wouldn't have carried it all the way here.

403
00:32:56,885 --> 00:32:58,645
You are at the end of your rope.

404
00:32:58,645 --> 00:33:02,705
I wonder how many of my moves you can block.

405
00:33:03,825 --> 00:33:05,724
How many moves?

406
00:33:05,724 --> 00:33:07,885
Try me and you'll find out.

407
00:33:12,625 --> 00:33:15,192
Fall back. Guard the perimeter of the barn.

408
00:33:15,192 --> 00:33:16,325
Don't let him escape.

409
00:33:16,325 --> 00:33:17,425
Yes, sir!

410
00:33:18,005 --> 00:33:20,571
I, Zhong Xiong, consider myself a hero.

411
00:33:20,571 --> 00:33:22,472
I've long yearned to fight the Southern Knight.

412
00:33:22,472 --> 00:33:24,472
But since you are now severely injured,

413
00:33:24,472 --> 00:33:27,165
it would be an unfair victory.

414
00:33:27,165 --> 00:33:29,372
The outcome of this battle, win or lose,

415
00:33:29,372 --> 00:33:31,271
will only be known to the two of us.

416
00:33:31,271 --> 00:33:33,645
I appreciate your consideration.

417
00:33:34,405 --> 00:33:37,705
May you have no regrets.

418
00:34:58,865 --> 00:35:00,331
As expected of the Southern Knight.

419
00:35:00,331 --> 00:35:01,831
Even while severely injured,

420
00:35:01,831 --> 00:35:03,938
you can still block so many of my moves.

421
00:35:03,938 --> 00:35:06,534
But if you continue to fight,

422
00:35:06,534 --> 00:35:11,185
the clash of injury and poison will likely
kill you on the spot!

423
00:35:11,765 --> 00:35:15,065
Chieftain Zhong,
do you think you've already won?

424
00:35:15,065 --> 00:35:18,045
If my flying fork had moved forward
half an inch,

425
00:35:18,045 --> 00:35:19,765
your blood would have stained this floor!

426
00:35:19,765 --> 00:35:22,932
Unless... you can fly?

427
00:36:08,005 --> 00:36:09,545
Could this be...

428
00:36:10,545 --> 00:36:12,645
Heavenward Crane Strike?

429
00:36:13,645 --> 00:36:15,925
The ultimate skill of the Ding family
from Songjiang Prefecture?

430
00:36:15,925 --> 00:36:17,705
How could you possibly know it?

431
00:36:24,305 --> 00:36:25,571
I told you...

432
00:36:26,285 --> 00:36:30,365
not to regret this fight.

433
00:36:32,585 --> 00:36:34,925
What a magnificent Heavenward Crane Strike.

434
00:36:35,865 --> 00:36:37,845
I, Zhong Xiong...

435
00:36:37,845 --> 00:36:41,245
have witnessed such peerless martial arts.

436
00:36:41,245 --> 00:36:43,665
My life is fulfilled.

437
00:36:44,765 --> 00:36:46,531
I was careless and underestimated you.

438
00:36:46,531 --> 00:36:48,245
The winner has been decided.

439
00:36:49,065 --> 00:36:52,565
Kill me if you wish!

440
00:36:54,405 --> 00:36:55,804
Killing you is easy.

441
00:36:56,425 --> 00:37:00,568
But outside this barn,
there are still dozens of your men.

442
00:37:00,568 --> 00:37:03,034
They won't let me go so easily.

443
00:37:03,034 --> 00:37:04,971
What do you want then?

444
00:37:05,585 --> 00:37:08,665
Past the farmhouse ahead is Xiqiao Ferry.

445
00:37:08,665 --> 00:37:10,132
Once across that river,

446
00:37:10,132 --> 00:37:12,599
it is no longer under Xiangzhou's jurisdiction.

447
00:37:12,599 --> 00:37:16,199
Another twenty miles will lead
to Yincheng Town,

448
00:37:16,199 --> 00:37:18,232
where the Guanghua Army is stationed.

449
00:37:18,232 --> 00:37:20,005
Their commander, Meng Kui, is my friend.

450
00:37:20,005 --> 00:37:22,928
He will send men to escort me
all the way north.

451
00:37:22,928 --> 00:37:28,332
With a fast horse,
I can reach the capital in less than two days.

452
00:37:28,332 --> 00:37:32,332
You want to take me hostage to get there?

453
00:37:39,625 --> 00:37:43,571
Not that far. Just to the ferry will do.

454
00:37:50,845 --> 00:37:52,145
Move aside.

455
00:38:06,005 --> 00:38:09,645
Chieftain Zhong, do not move recklessly.

456
00:38:09,645 --> 00:38:11,971
Heavenward Crane Strike has locked
your heart pulse.

457
00:38:11,971 --> 00:38:13,885
If you force your internal energy
to break free,

458
00:38:13,885 --> 00:38:15,301
you will die from the backlash.

459
00:38:15,301 --> 00:38:16,411
Don't worry.

460
00:38:16,411 --> 00:38:18,445
I don't want to die just yet.

461
00:38:18,445 --> 00:38:24,445
If I die, how can I see how long
your Heavenward Crane Strike can hold out?

462
00:38:42,325 --> 00:38:47,024
Do you think taking me hostage
guarantees a safe passage to the ferry?

463
00:38:47,024 --> 00:38:50,624
You have more than just my group on your tail.

464
00:38:50,624 --> 00:38:52,645
Let us go!

465
00:39:01,565 --> 00:39:04,765
Please let our family go!

466
00:39:23,305 --> 00:39:26,805
These arrows are tipped with
our Xiuluo Cult poison.

467
00:39:26,805 --> 00:39:28,965
One hit means instant death.

468
00:39:29,805 --> 00:39:33,938
If I were you,
I wouldn't take another step forward.

469
00:39:33,938 --> 00:39:36,905
You dare use innocent civilians as leverage?

470
00:39:37,905 --> 00:39:42,355
These people could have
lived their lives in peace.

471
00:39:42,355 --> 00:39:46,605
You're the cause of their plight.

472
00:39:47,665 --> 00:39:49,315
As the renowned Southern Knight,

473
00:39:49,315 --> 00:39:52,125
can you really just stand by and watch?

474
00:39:53,125 --> 00:39:54,565
Yan Zi Qing!

475
00:39:54,565 --> 00:39:57,171
The Yunying Sect was a righteous sect.

476
00:39:57,171 --> 00:40:01,625
Why did you betray your master
to collude with the Xiuluo Cult?

477
00:40:04,965 --> 00:40:07,799
Zhan Zhao, hand it over,

478
00:40:07,799 --> 00:40:11,465
and these people will live.

479
00:40:15,125 --> 00:40:16,292
Chieftain Zhong.

480
00:40:17,204 --> 00:40:21,085
Today, your Iron Blood Guards and
the Xiuluo Cult have joined forces to stop me.

481
00:40:21,085 --> 00:40:22,845
When it comes time to claim credit,

482
00:40:22,845 --> 00:40:24,405
I wonder how it will be divided.

483
00:40:24,405 --> 00:40:27,375
In my eyes, only gratitude and loyalty matter.

484
00:40:27,375 --> 00:40:30,905
I don't care about the feuds
or the fate of the imperial court.

485
00:40:30,905 --> 00:40:32,688
If not to repay a debt of gratitude,

486
00:40:32,688 --> 00:40:35,705
I would never associate with
such a despicable man.

487
00:40:39,685 --> 00:40:41,675
Although your water fortress

488
00:40:41,675 --> 00:40:44,445
was outlawed and purged by the court,

489
00:40:44,445 --> 00:40:46,685
but it never harassed the common people.

490
00:40:46,685 --> 00:40:49,801
But now, the benefactor you serve

491
00:40:49,801 --> 00:40:54,021
is acting in a way that completely
contradicts your own sense of honor.

492
00:40:54,021 --> 00:40:56,071
Are you really going to turn a blind eye?

493
00:40:56,071 --> 00:40:59,041
Zhan Zhao, there's no need to provoke me.

494
00:40:59,041 --> 00:41:01,354
If you want me to do something, just say it.

495
00:41:01,354 --> 00:41:03,838
I want to know if I move to save them now,

496
00:41:04,485 --> 00:41:06,919
will the Iron Blood Guards assist Mo Dao?

497
00:41:06,919 --> 00:41:07,985
Save them?

498
00:41:08,605 --> 00:41:09,899
How can you?

499
00:41:09,899 --> 00:41:11,885
This is a dead end.

500
00:41:13,878 --> 00:41:15,525
That is my concern.

501
00:41:16,525 --> 00:41:18,645
Chieftain Zhong, just tell me.

502
00:41:18,645 --> 00:41:21,385
Will you, or won't you?

503
00:41:23,712 --> 00:41:26,905
I truly despise such despicable methods.

504
00:41:26,905 --> 00:41:28,845
Go ahead and save them.

505
00:41:28,845 --> 00:41:31,605
The Iron Blood Guards will not interfere.

506
00:41:31,605 --> 00:41:34,445
However, we won't help you either.

507
00:41:34,445 --> 00:41:36,012
Thank you.

508
00:41:44,005 --> 00:41:48,845
Zhan Zhao, can you really bear
to watch them perish because of you?

509
00:41:49,845 --> 00:41:51,804
They will not perish!

510
00:41:51,804 --> 00:41:53,471
Fine.

511
00:41:53,471 --> 00:41:56,771
I'd like to see just how many you can save.

512
00:41:57,645 --> 00:42:00,325
- Please, let us go!
- No!

513
00:42:01,325 --> 00:42:02,905
Have mercy!

514
00:42:02,905 --> 00:42:05,371
Father! Mother!

